{
  "description": "Phase B eval suite — 5 skills × 3 prompts = 15 cases. Tests skill triggering, MCP tool dispatch, source tagging, and anti-fabrication clauses. Requires uk-legal-mcp.fly.dev to be reachable for tool_called assertions.",
